Package: GimmeMyOmics
Title: Omics Data Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Etienne", "Camenen", email = "etienne.camenen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for high-throughput omics analysis. It provides functions for differential expression analysis, functional enrichment, and network-based annotation. The package also includes a variety of visualization tools, such as volcano plots, heatmaps, violin plots, and pathway diagrams, to facilitate data exploration and interpretation.
